      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Finally, out in a residential neighborhood, Muranishi rings doorbells to sell English encyclopedias. With a stiff, nervous grin, he gets doors shut in his face one after another while Ono watches from across the street. Listen to how customers turn him down.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
