      "t": "これからの時代、英語が必要になってきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the coming era, English is going to become necessary.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "今は忙しいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
